In this project, I demonstrate how multiple computers communicate and share files over a network. The network consists of three PCs connected through a switch, an FTP server for transferring documents, and a DNS server for translating domain names into IP addresses. The main goal is to show how these devices work together and how a document can be transferred from one computer to the FTP server using the FTP protocol.

